  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "もくげきれいは　かこ　１けんのみ。ふるい　たんけんきに　しるされたなぞの　せいぶつに　にた　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "목격된 사례는 과거에 단 1건뿐이다. 오래된 탐험기에 기록된 정체불명의 생물을 닮은 포켓몬.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "過去只有過１次目擊紀錄。是與古老的探險記裡記載的神秘生物長得很像的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon n’avait été aperçu qu’une seule fois jusqu’ici. Il ressemble à une créature mystérieuse évoquée dans un vieux récit d’exploration.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bisher wurde es nur ein Mal gesichtet. Es ähnelt einer rätselhaften Kreatur, die in einem alten Expeditionsbericht beschrieben wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solo se había avistado una vez en el pasado. Su aspecto se asemeja al de una misteriosa criatura descrita en cierto diario antiguo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È stato avvistato una sola volta in passato. Ricorda molto una creatura misteriosa descritta in un vecchio diario di viaggio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "There has been only one reported sighting of this Pokémon. It resembles a mysterious creature depicted in an old expedition journal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "目撃例は　過去　１件のみ。古い　探検記に　記された謎の　生物に　似た　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "过去只有１次目击纪录。这只宝可梦与古老的探险记所记载的神秘生物长得很像。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solo se había avistado una vez en el pasado. Su aspecto se asemeja al de una misteriosa criatura descrita en cierto diario antiguo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１０おくねんまえの　プリンとオカルトざっしが　しょうかいしたなぞの　ポケモンに　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "10억 년 전의 푸린이라며 오컬트 잡지에 소개됐던 정체불명의 포켓몬을 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與超自然雜誌裡被當成１０億年前的胖丁來介紹的謎之寶可夢長得很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à un Pokémon mystérieux qui serait un Rondoudou d’il y a un milliard d’années, selon une revue sur les phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt einem rätselhaften Pokémon, das in einer esoterischen Zeitschrift als ein Pummeluff von vor einer Milliarde Jahren vorgestellt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda similitud con el supuesto aspecto que, según una revista esotérica, tenía Jigglypuff hace mil millones de años.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Somiglia a un Pokémon enigmatico presentato in una rivista di paranormale come un Jigglypuff di un miliardo di anni fa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It resembles a mysterious Pokémon described in a paranormal magazine as a Jigglypuff from one billion years ago.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１０億年前の　プリンとオカルト雑誌が　紹介した謎の　ポケモンに　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "超自然杂志曾将某只神秘的宝可梦介绍为１０亿年前的胖丁，该宝可梦与它长得很相似。",
